  <link:footnoteLink xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/link" xlink:type="extended">
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-1" id="fn-1" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">"Other Changes" in Construction Work in Progress (Account 107) all relate to assets going into service.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-2" id="fn-2" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">"Other Changes" in Service Company Property section represent Software transferred to Service Company and lease related charges.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-3" id="fn-3" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">"Other Changes" in Service Company Property represent transfer of Software to Service Company and other Software activity</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-4" id="fn-4" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Miscellaneous Paid in Capital represents a capital contribution from Alliant Energy Corporation made in 2012.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-5" id="fn-5" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Unappropriated Retained Earnings includes undistributed net income from compensation for use of capital billed for support of services provided to associate companies.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-6" id="fn-6" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Advances from Associate Company - Alliant Energy Corporation - Advances on open account which were partially offset by reclasses from this account to a Current Liability.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-7" id="fn-7" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Amounts reported are recorded at Alliant Energy Corporate Services, Inc. and are not billed to associate companies.</link:footnote>
